      "title": "PromptForge",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## PromptForge Krea2 workflow\n\nPromptForge fills in, by node title:\n\n* **✅ Positive Encode** - the prompt it wrote\n* **❌ Negative Encode** - the negative\n* **Size** - width and height from the Render panel\n* **KSampler** - steps, CFG, sampler, scheduler, seed\n* **Model / Text encoder / VAE** - the files picked in the Render panel\n* **Lora Loader** - LoRAs and strengths\n\nOne model per workflow on purpose: no group bypassers.\nDefaults: 8 steps, CFG 1, euler / simple."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## PromptForge Krea2 workflow\n\nPromptForge fills in, by node title:\n\n* **✅ Positive Encode** - the prompt it wrote\n* **❌ Negative Encode** - the negative\n* **Size** - width and height from the Render panel\n* **KSampler** - steps, CFG, sampler, scheduler, seed\n* **Model / Text encoder / VAE** - the files picked in the Render panel\n* **Lora Loader** - LoRAs and strengths\n\nOne model per workflow on purpose: no group bypassers.\nDefaults: 8 steps, CFG 1, euler / simple."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
